-- =========================================================
-- One-time real-data import: OG Book Cafe (our first live client),
-- migrating off their old Supabase project + Vercel hosting onto
-- this VPS. This is NOT a repeatable schema migration -- it is a
-- single data load, safe to run exactly once against a fresh
-- database that has no 'ogbookcafe' tenant yet.
--
-- Staff logins are preserved unchanged: both auth_users rows carry
-- their REAL existing bcrypt password hashes (copied byte-for-byte
-- from the Supabase auth.users table), so the owner and cashier
-- keep signing in with the same email + password they already use
-- today. Nothing to reset, nothing to communicate to staff.
--
-- Covers: tenant + tenant_settings (real business config: tax,
-- invoice prefix, branding, opening hours, etc.), both staff
-- logins, all 72 real menu/category/table/order/dayclose records,
-- and all 18 real guest self-order rows.
--
-- Known follow-up (not blocking): tenant_settings.branding's
-- siteHero / siteAboutImg / siteGallery URLs still point at the
-- OLD Supabase Storage bucket. They'll keep working as long as
-- that Supabase project stays up, but the owner should re-upload
-- those photos via Settings > Website once live here, to drop the
-- Supabase dependency completely.
--
-- Insert order matters (FK-safe): auth_users -> tenants ->
-- guest_orders -> profiles -> records -> tenant_settings.
-- =========================================================






